     fhir:div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: PlanDefinition DIVIQualityIndicator6</b></p><a name=\"DIVIQualityIndicator6\"> </a><a name=\"hcDIVIQualityIndicator6\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"https://www.netzwerk-universitaetsmedizin.de/fhir/cpg-on-ebm-on-fhir/StructureDefinition-recommendation.html\">Recommendation</a></p></div><blockquote><p><b>Action Combination Method</b></p><ul><li>method: <span title=\"Codes:{https://www.netzwerk-universitaetsmedizin.de/fhir/cpg-on-ebm-on-fhir/CodeSystem/cs-action-combination-method all}\">All</span></li></ul></blockquote><p><b>knowledgeCapability</b>: computable</p><p><b>knowledgeRepresentationLevel</b>: structured</p><p><b>url</b>: <a href=\"PlanDefinition-DIVIQualityIndicator6.html\">PlanDefinition DIVI Quality Indicator 6</a></p><p><b>version</b>: 1.0</p><p><b>name</b>: DiVI_QualityIndicator_6</p><p><b>title</b>: DIVI Quality Indicator 6</p><p><b>type</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type workflow-definition}\">Workflow Definition</span></p><p><b>status</b>: Active</p><p><b>experimental</b>: true</p><p><b>date</b>: 2024-03-29</p><p><b>publisher</b>: Deutsche Interdisziplinäre Vereinigung für Intensiv- und Notfallmedizin (DIVI)</p><p><b>description</b>: </p><div><p>DIVI Quality Indicator 6: Infection Management</p>\n</div><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><p><b>title</b>: DIVI Quality Indicator 6a: Indication, Focus and Duration of Therapy for Antibiotics</p><p><b>description</b>: </p><div><p>All Intensive Care Patients with Antibiotics should have a daily re-evaluation of the Indication, Focus and Duration of Therapy for each Antibiotic.</p>\n</div><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cpg/CodeSystem/cpg-common-process guideline-based-care}\">Guideline-based Care</span></p><p><b>definition</b>: <a href=\"PlanDefinition-AntibioticsIndicationFocusDuration.html\">Indication, Focus and Duration of Therapy for Antibiotics</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><b>action</b></p><p><b>title</b>: DIVI Quality Indicator 6b: Frequency of Blood Cultures</p><p><b>description</b>: </p><div><p>The Frequency of Blood Cultures should be at least 80 per 1000 days.</p>\n</div><p><b>code</b>: <span title=\"Codes:{http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/cpg/CodeSystem/cpg-common-process guideline-based-care}\">Guideline-based Care</span></p><p><b>definition</b>: <a href=\"PlanDefinition-FrequencyBloodCultures.html\">Frequency of Blood Cultures</a></p></blockquote></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral
